WEBVTT

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:07.530
Every unfinished line finds its true meaning when different worlds…

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:20.340
What is this world? A sea of light and lines.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.520
It goes on forever… So much power.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:36.540
Welcome to the neon flow. Let's create something beautiful together.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.880
Are you ready to spark your imagination?

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.960
I am the Layer Architect.

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:44.400
Let us bring order to this chaos.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.720
All things must follow the grid.
